  "body": "When a Web Worker is created from a url, it receives an endpoint based on the url. This endpoint is the default location for things like `import`. But when created from a local resource, there is no remote endpoint. This complicates getting imports. It would be helpful to be able to assign an endpoint to a Worker created using a local resource, preferably in the constructor.",
